    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market a charming 3 bedroom property extending to c. 81 sqm / 871 sqft. Having been well maintained and upgraded by the current owner it is in great condition throughout.The accommodation briefly comprises of living/dining area, utility and kitchen. There are two bedrooms and main bathroom on the first floor and a spacious third bedroom on the 2nd floor with en suite.Homeville Court is a small quiet development located off the old Knocklyon Road. The property is also within easy walking distance of both Knocklyon and Firhouse Shopping Centres. Those who enjoy the great outdoors will be spoilt for choice with Tymon Park, Marley Park and St Enda's parks and their excellent recreational facilities and amenities. This property is also within the catchment area for the most reputable St. Colmcille's primary and secondary schools. There is ease of access to the M50 road network and public transport is well catered for with numerous Dublin Bus services travelling to and from the city centre.\n\n\nEarly viewing highly recommended!"
      },
